{"id":"6061af339630925b","group":"72","path":"72/72-lem-system-f-substitution.md","title":"System F的项与类型代入","display":"lem-system-f-substitution — System F的项与类型代入","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-lem-system-f-substitution","aliases":["72-lem-system-f-substitution"],"display":"lem-system-f-substitution — System F的项与类型代入","depends_on":["[[72-df-system-f]]","[[72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction]]"],"chapter":"X","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.X §§2.2,3.6, print698–700,741/PDF710–712,753 (context); local consequences of the existing typed lambda interfaces; inherited supplementary sources not rechecked","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local proof recorded and manually reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revised":"2026-10-22"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-lem-system-f-substitution"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-lem-system-f-substitution</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-system-f-substitution — System F的项与类型代入"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a59aab1599221f4a\" href=\"?note=a59aab1599221f4a\" title=\"72-df-system-f\">72-df-system-f</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3cb0b5b1c6108aea\" href=\"?note=3cb0b5b1c6108aea\" title=\"72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction\">72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"X"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.X §§2.2,3.6, print698–700,741/PDF710–712,753 (context); local consequences of the existing typed lambda interfaces; inherited supplementary sources not rechecked"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local proof recorded and manually reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-22"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,\\Lambda_F,\\mathsf{Ty}_F,\\vdash_F\">\\(\\Gamma,\\Lambda_F,\\mathsf{Ty}_F,\\vdash_F\\)</span>、项及类型的避免捕获替换取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a59aab1599221f4a\" href=\"?note=a59aab1599221f4a\" title=\"72-df-system-f\">72-df-system-f</a> 与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3cb0b5b1c6108aea\" href=\"?note=3cb0b5b1c6108aea\" title=\"72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction\">72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_F\">\\(A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_F\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N\\in\\Lambda_F\">\\(M,N\\in\\Lambda_F\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\in V_T\">\\(U\\in V_T\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(\\Gamma)\">\\(x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma[B/U]\">\\(\\Gamma[B/U]\\)</span> 在下式作有限函数图构造。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma[B/U]:=\\{\\langle y,D[B/U]\\rangle:\\langle y,D\\rangle\\in\\Gamma\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma[B/U]:=\\{\\langle y,D[B/U]\\rangle:\\langle y,D\\rangle\\in\\Gamma\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash_F M:C\\land\\Gamma\\vdash_F N:A\\\n\\Longrightarrow\\ \\Gamma\\vdash_F M[N/x]:C.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash_F M:C\\land\\Gamma\\vdash_F N:A\\\n\\Longrightarrow\\ \\Gamma\\vdash_F M[N/x]:C.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_F M:A\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\Gamma[B/U]\\vdash_F M[B/U]:A[B/U].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_F M:A\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\Gamma[B/U]\\vdash_F M[B/U]:A[B/U].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>两个结论各对typing推导归纳。项变量、应用及项抽象如简单类型情形，必要的弱化通过同样的结构归纳得到。项代入遇到类型抽象时，先将其类型绑定者改为避开N全部自由类型变量的新变量，避免捕获N注解中的类型变量；全称引入的旁条件仍成立。类型代入遇到全称引入时，选新类型变量W避开Γ、B和U全部相关变量，使W不会因插入B而进入替换后的上下文。全称消去分支用避免捕获代入的交换等式；类型绑定者等于U时停止递归。两套语法均按α类解释，所以新鲜选择不改变结果。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-system-f","status":"resolved","id":"a59aab1599221f4a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-system-f]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"3cb0b5b1c6108aea","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-system-f","status":"resolved","id":"a59aab1599221f4a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Gamma,\\Lambda_F,\\mathsf{Ty}_F,\\vdash_F$、项及类型的避免捕获替换取 [[72-df-system-f]] 与 [[72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"3cb0b5b